Every PDMP-risk-score-algorithm can reportedly generate a PDMP-risk-score.
Every PDMP-risk-score-algorithm is a proprietary-algorithm and is not a publicly-available-algorithm.
Every PDMP-risk-score-algorithm uses a patient-EHR-information and uses an other-source-information.
An other-source-example includes a court-record-example and includes a criminal-history-example and includes a sexual-trauma-history-example.
Every PDMP-risk-score-algorithm can possibly affect a woman disparately.
Every PDMP-risk-score-algorithm can possibly affect a person-of-color disparately.
Every PDMP-risk-score-algorithm can possibly affect a person-living-in-poverty disparately.
